  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Thursday 10 December 2026 at 10:00AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\n868m² OF FREEHOLD LAND - AN EXCEPTIONAL WATERFRONT LIFESTYLE\r\n\r\nSome properties are special. Others are truly irreplaceable. With an extraordinary 868m² freehold title, a remarkable family history spanning more than 55 years, and some of the most beautiful water at your doorstep, this is an opportunity that deserves your attention.\r\n\r\nCherished by the same family for over five decades, this substantial waterfront property combines timeless character, modern luxury and an enviable coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nThe upper level has been completely transformed into a beautifully renovated, luxurious private sanctuary. Two generous bedrooms, a stunning contemporary kitchen and beautifully appointed living spaces capture the spectacular sea views, creating an apartment-like retreat where the outlook and surroundings take centre stage. Imagine morning coffees overlooking the water, evenings entertaining against a breathtaking coastal backdrop, and the simple pleasure of having the beach and boating lifestyle quite literally at your feet.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, two original bedrooms provide a wonderful opportunity to add your own personality, style and design vision. Whether you choose to create a substantial family home, accommodate teenagers who appreciate their own space, provide independent living for extended family, or explore additional income through Airbnb or longer-term accommodation, the possibilities are exciting.\r\n\r\nBut it is the setting that truly sets this property apart.\r\n\r\nThis is coastal at its very best. Deep, beautiful, sheltered water invites swimming, boating and endless summer enjoyment. Take a refreshing dip from your own waterfront, paddle board, kayak, head out on the boat, enjoy the nearby Cove, or become part of the renowned local sailing community. For those who love the water, this is a lifestyle that is hard to match.\r\n\r\nThe generous freehold landholding provides space, privacy and future possibilities rarely found in such a coveted waterfront position. Families, boating enthusiasts, investors and those dreaming of creating something truly special will immediately appreciate the opportunity on offer.\r\n\r\nA home with history. A setting with distinction. A waterfront lifestyle to treasure.\r\n\r\nEndless potential. An extraordinary place to call home.",
